 <li><span class="rl-author">Internet Archive. <em lang="en">A Dissertation Concerning the Antiquity of the Hebrew Language, Letters, Vowel-Points, and Accents</em> (1767) —
 <a href="https://archive.org/details/bim_eighteenth-century_a-dissertation-concernin_gill-john_1767" rel="noopener" target="_blank">факсимиле</a>.</span></li>
 <li><span class="rl-author">Google Play. <em lang="en">A Dissertation Concerning the Baptism of Jewish Proselytes</em> (1771) —
 <a href="https://play.google.com/store/books/details/John_GILL_D_D_Baptist_Minister_at_Horsley_Down_A_d?id=2b1lAAAAcAAJ" rel="noopener" target="_blank">полное бесплатное издание, 100 цифровых страниц</a>.</span></li>
 <li><span class="rl-author">University of Pennsylvania, <em lang="en">The Online Books Page: John Gill</em> —
 <a href="https://onlinebooks.library.upenn.edu/webbin/book/lookupname?key=Gill%2C+John%2C+1697-1771" rel="noopener" target="_blank">курируемый каталог открытых и библиотечных копий</a>.</span> Стабильный библиографический шлюз к CCEL, Internet Archive и HathiTrust; запись каталога не подменяет сверку с конкретным изданием.</li>
 </ul>
